{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/extras/93.png?t=1711377325\" /><br><br><strong>Midline \u201885</strong> is an interactive thriller about working as an emergency service operator in a small town. Face the fears, desires and cruelty of people caught in trouble, as well as calls from your coworkers, friends, or even enemies. You will observe six months of Elena\u2019s work, from her first day on the job to the story\u2019s finale. Only your choices determine how it ends.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/extras/Frame_40.png?t=1711377325\" /><br>Study Midline for the smallest details of its life: local radio broadcasts, the morning paper, or work mail. Find information that will unlock new dialogue options. But remember: there is no knowing where an unexplored path might take you\u2026<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/extras/Frame_46.png?t=1711377325\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/extras/Frame_45.png?t=1711377325\" /><br>Your telephone is your only weapon. Use information you\u2019ve gathered outside of calls, monitor the person on the other end\u2019s mental state. Lie, intimidate, investigate or play by the book \u2014 there\u2019s no tactic you shouldn\u2019t try when someone\u2019s life is at stake. Time is working against you, but it\u2019s no reason to despair.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/extras/Frame_42.png?t=1711377325\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/extras/Frame_44.png?t=1711377325\" /><br>The past casts long shadows. Your actions affect the state of the protagonist, who cannot forget people\u2019s deaths or her own mistakes. See the consequences in her character, available dialogue options and ultimately the ending.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/extras/Frame_37.png?t=1711377325\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2384710?t=1711377325","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1711377325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1711377325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1711377325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/extras/93.png?t=1711377325\" /><br><br><strong>Midline \u201885</strong> is an interactive thriller about working as an emergency service operator in a small town. Face the fears, desires and cruelty of people caught in trouble, as well as calls from your coworkers, friends, or even enemies. You will observe six months of Elena\u2019s work, from her first day on the job to the story\u2019s finale. Only your choices determine how it ends.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384710/extras/Frame_40.png?t=1711377325\" /><br>Study Midline for the smallest details of its life: local radio broadcasts, the morning paper, or work mail. Find information that will unlock new dialogue options. But remember: there is no knowin